property done, ms
global glob

on startStep me
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] setprop 66 .............................. done = 0
  [  3] getmovieprop 90 ......................... <the milliSeconds>
  [  5] pushint16 2000 .......................... <2000>
  [  8] add ..................................... <the milliSeconds + 2000>
  [  9] setprop 89 .............................. ms = the milliSeconds + 2000
  [ 11] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 13] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <1>
  [ 15] extcall 44 .............................. return 1
  [ 17] ret
end

on checkDone me
  [  0] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [  2] jmpifz [  9] ............................ if done then
  [  5] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  7] extcall 44 .............................. return 
  [  9] getmovieprop 90 ......................... <the milliSeconds>
  [ 11] getprop 89 .............................. <ms>
  [ 13] gt ...................................... <the milliSeconds > ms>
  [ 14] setprop 66 .............................. done = the milliSeconds > ms
  [ 16] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [ 18] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <done>
  [ 20] extcall 44 .............................. return done
  [ 22] ret
end
